        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For certain operations where we sell or intend to sell natural gas, we are responsible for obtaining gas marketing licenses, and as we expand our natural gas sales line of business to new markets, we will be responsible for obtaining licenses in those markets.",
